From: rosemary port
Subject: [PATCH 0063] rosemary touch: Goodix GENI packing replaced by MTK I2C PIO

On rosemary (MT6785) the touch transport is MediaTek i2c-mt65xx PIO, not
Qualcomm GENI QUP. The full Goodix GT9896 protocol (status 0x4180, report
0x4188, ack write 0) is implemented directly in rosemary_touch.c from patch
0060, so the GENI FIFO-packing changes this patch previously carried are
obsolete. Kept as a trivial no-op to preserve patch numbering 0001-0081.

